      "en": "Dinah, the daughter of Leah, whom she bore to Jacob, went out to see the daughters of the land.",
      "ko": "레아가 야곱에게 낳은 딸 디나가 그 땅 여자를 보러 나갔더니",
      "source_text_hash": "1ea2c0f1405d8f9391b9e8140668d1f3cdded5fa29137742a425fb00771a987a",
      "translation_text_hash": "9f8733c0dd58cdfbdb46ecd25ad547400659961166b06b1e4d75298ecd7e867f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
