        }
      ],
      "en": "Shechem spoke to his father, Hamor, saying, “Get me this young lady as a wife.”",
      "ko": "그 아비 하몰에게 청하여 가로되 이 소녀를 내 아내로 얻게 하여 주소서 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8e7a26ef8dc4c14c597034efb81decd0d8ae59120dad11c62b582d051d916962",
      "translation_text_hash": "38935bdab91d75725e64e951cd45efb01d705b9233bbe39e4e1217eebc8d3204",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
