      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 34,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "Make marriages with us. Give your daughters to us, and take our daughters for yourselves.",
      "ko": "너희가 우리와 통혼하여 너희 딸을 우리에게 주며 우리 딸을 너희가 취하고",
      "source_text_hash": "aa6d6484740dedffdd985b7eac5d5cdec8b22b2eacddb39a7b1048f060406aae",
      "translation_text_hash": "5fda4594021a82a2dbf831be7d00a12d191de34e96201bc39e0fa4ba07d66ab5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희가 우리와 통혼하여 너희 딸을 우리에게 주며 우리 딸을 너희가 취하고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5fda4594021a82a2dbf831be7d00a12d191de34e96201bc39e0fa4ba07d66ab5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GEN:34:10",
      "sequence": 991,
      "chapter_label": "GEN 34",
      "verse_label": "10",
      "locator": {
        "book": "GEN",
